A Git-like CLI (git v1.0.0)

USAGE:
  git [COMMANDS] <OPTIONS>

COMMANDS:
  branch          Manage branches
  remote          Manage remotes

For more info, run any command with the `--help` flag:
  git branch --help
  git remote --help

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help             Display this help message
  -v, --version          Display this version

